# Written, not lifted: electrolites/codegen/ emits these three from the
# angular-momentum class alone in 0.7 s, byte for byte the same every time,
# and electrolites/_gen.py produces and caches them on first use.  13 MB of
# straight-line CUDA does not belong in the history for that.  The kernels
# that are *lifted* out of a GPU4PySCF source file are a different matter and
# stay tracked -- regenerating those needs a checkout an installed user has
# no reason to have.
electrolites/kernels/fastjhigh_generated.cu
electrolites/kernels/fastkhigh_generated.cu
electrolites/kernels/fastejk_generated.cu
